      "created_at": "2018-09-11T13:43:25Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-09-11T13:43:25Z",
      "body": "> Both Heap and Mixpanel have a free tier, but are paid beyond that, and are quite expensive. In the future I imagine we might have a Patreon or similar to fund services like this, but for now we should assume that we might need to switch providers if we outgrow the one we pick, and find a cheaper alternative.\r\n\r\nIf you outgrow Mixpanel, you could contact them to see if they’d be willing to give us a free plan since we’re open source.",
